<task id="054" project="unified-access-control-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Service-request access: close the ISS-003 to-do over-denial — explicitly NOT a fourth accessible root set (FR-27)</title>
    <phase>3 Child inheritance</phase>
    <gate>blocked — requires Phase 1 (FR-19 evaluator, FR-20 impersonated root sets) merged</gate>
    <status>pending</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Authorization-path .cs in Infrastructure/ExternalAccess — changes what every external caller can reach.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical generalization following three existing root-set implementations as the literal pattern; boundaries fully specified.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>phase3-wave3</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/** (CallerPrincipalResolver, AccessibleRecordSetService, WorkforcePrincipalResolver) — the project's declared exclusive-file zone.</parallel-reason>
